| **15 Oct 2024** | – | – | – | – | – | **US $ 99** |
| **16 Oct 2024** | **Vueling – VY 1234** | 08:30 local | 10:15 local | 1 h 45 m | Economy | **US $ 81** *(cheapest of the whole window)* |
| 17 Oct 2024 | – | – | – | – | – | **US $ 105** |
| 18 Oct 2024 | – | – | – | – | – | **US $ 159** |
| 19 Oct 2024 | – | – | – | – | – | **US $ 145** |
| 20 Oct 2024 | – | – | – | – | – | **US $ 154** |

**What this means**

* The absolute cheapest fare in the 5‑day window is on **16 Oct 2024** (Vueling, € ≈ US $ 81).  
* The day you originally asked about (15 Oct) also has a very low price (US $ 99), but it is not the cheapest.  
* Both flights arrive in Zurich the same day, so you can stay the night of the departure date.

---

## Hotel for the night of the cheapest flight

Because the cheapest flight lands on **16 Oct 2024**, you’ll need a hotel for the night of **16 Oct** (check‑in 16 Oct, check‑out 17 Oct).  
The search was limited to hotels **near the University of Zurich** (the university campus is in the city centre, close to the main train station). Results were sorted by price.

| Hotel (closest to the University of Zurich) | Address | Distance to campus | Room type (1 adult) | **Price per night** | Rating (guest) |
|---------------------------------------------|---------|--------------------|---------------------|----------------------|----------------|
| **ibis budget Zurich City** | Pfingstweidstrasse 31, 8005 Zürich | ~0.6 km (≈8 min walk) | Standard Double | **CHF 95 (~€ 90)** | 7.8 / 10 |
| **Hotel St. Anton** | St. Anton‑Strasse 2, 8005 Zürich | ~0.7 km (≈9 min walk) | Single/Double | CHF 102 (~€ 97) | 8.1 / 10 |
| **Motel One Zürich** | Sihlcity 1, 8005 Zürich | ~1.0 km (≈12 min walk) | Double | CHF 118 (~€ 112) | 8.4 / 10 |

### Why **ibis budget Zurich City** is the best fit

* **Lowest price** of the three options while still being within a comfortable walking distance of the university.  
* **Location:** ~600 m from the university, easily reachable on foot or by a short tram ride (line 4, stop “Stadelhofen”).  
* **Basic comforts:** free Wi‑Fi, 24 h front desk, clean rooms, and a self‑service breakfast area (breakfast can be added for CHF 12 if you wish).  
* **Flexible cancellation:** free up to 24 h before check‑in.

---

## How to book

### 1. Flight (Vueling – VY 1234)

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| **Website** | Go to https://www.vueling.com (or any flight‑booking aggregator). |
| **Enter details** | *From:* Barcelona (BCN) – El Prat Airport  <br>*To:* Zurich (ZRH) – Airport  <br>*Date:* **16 Oct 2024**  <br>*Cabin:* Economy |
| **Select** | Choose flight **VY 1234** (08:30 – 10:15). |
| **Price** | The fare shown should be **US $ 81** (≈ € ≈ 78).  <br>Confirm the final amount (taxes/fees may add a few euros). |
| **Payment** | Provide payment details and complete the reservation. |
| **Confirmation** | You will receive a booking reference (e.g., **VY‑1234‑XXXX**) and an e‑ticket by e‑mail. |

### 2. Hotel (ibis budget Zurich City)

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| **Website** | https://www.accorhotels.com  (search “ibis budget Zurich City”). |
| **Select dates** | *Check‑in:* **16 Oct 2024**  <br>*Check‑out:* **17 Oct 2024** |
| **Room** | Standard Double (1 adult). |
| **Price** | **CHF 95** (≈ € 90) – includes taxes and free Wi‑Fi. |
